  "body": "## Current source\n\nHead: `29080ef8cd1a5b385eeeec97976fbefd31280427`, tree `5ddbea2b1d5e76ed592a27c36079632d7f26cada`. Main remains unchanged. The latest commit changes one existing Python workflow-contract method and preserves all2268 other leaves exactly; all product, shader, scene, model and workflow bytes remain identical to47ca.\n\n## Implemented production behavior\n\n- The routed learning world now contains14 concrete English mesh identities, including all10 grade-1/2 school-supplies words. New geometric props include bag, eraser, school bag, desk, chair, pencil case and paper. Readable compact headers preserve19dp text and52dp actions.\n- Quiz accepts legitimate nullable explanations and normalizes validated numeric hidden-answer indexes in both display and input guards. Original failed authority JSON is committed as the regression fixture.\n- The routed Memory table uses the original artwork, thick cards, actual flips, match indicators and page-aware inputs. Dart retains rules, opponent decisions, durable rounds and rewards.\n\n## Actual47ca product evidence\n\n[Authority run43607369297](https://github.com/Ullmann27/lumo-godot/actions/runs/43607369297) completed all three activities with actual Host50503:\n- English:7649 native checks,196 Godot touches,17 current original PNGs individually inspected; actual Dart producer2955 assertions across10 cases.\n- Quiz:20-question pair completed381 checks,454 input events and67 requests, both process exits0; exactly one5000-star QA-ledger effect. All six current PNGs inspected.\n- Memory:19 actual touch pairs produced19 acknowledged requests, three durable returns/new session tokens and exactly one QA award.28 PNGs decoded;15 selected states/layouts/motion frames individually inspected.\n\nThese desktop pairs use explicit QA transport/store/clock/ledger adapters. They do not approve Android Binder, a production-wallet payout, heard speech or physical-device performance. Original artifacts and the earlier negative runs are preserved separately.\n\n## Concrete failure and narrow correction\n\n[Full47ca Studio run43607369276](https://github.com/Ullmann27/lumo-godot/actions/runs/43607369276) failed. Six independent jobs passed, but new-worlds stopped before its gameplay suites: one of16 existing Python contracts still expected the closed single-Studio-branch literal. Bundle and archive jobs were skipped.\n\nThe corrected existing method now verifies exactly the two authorized development branches, the complete repository/branch archive guard, and immutable artifact SOURCE_SHA/RUN_ID binding. No gate is removed. The existing16 runner contracts pass locally with no skips; independent review confirms that all other assertions, workflow bytes and product sources are unchanged.\n\nThe new [29080 authority run43611803404](https://github.com/Ullmann27/lumo-godot/actions/runs/43611803404) is now **completed SUCCESS for all three activities**, still explicitly bound to actual Host50503. Its new originals have been independently downloaded, hashed and reviewed: English7633 checks/196 Godot touches/17 viewed PNGs; Quiz381 checks/67 requests/6 viewed PNGs; Memory19 acknowledged requests/one QA award/15 viewed PNGs from28 decoded. Each owner inspected these newly generated images; prior47ca images are not substituted.\n\nThe separate [complete Native 29080 run 43611803408](https://github.com/Ullmann27/lumo-godot/actions/runs/43611803408) is now **completed SUCCESS for all nine jobs**. Root downloaded its original 227,270,408-byte archive once, verified SHA256 `f9d84c3d4f80f27fe134ab5e4cb040b811262d6d6c6a032433bc5f644ed886fc` and all 5,085 ZIP CRCs, and verified five clean current-source stamps. All 49 selected current images have now been personally reviewed by Root and the three agents, and the unchanged recorder accepted their exact current-source receipt. Host commit `b7210db3f53361987fd33592de438fd7984d991a` now pins this Native source; its own Feature/Android acceptance is separate and still running. The current movie strictly decodes all 148 frames; Root personally opened 16 selected frames. Recording at 24 fps is not device performance, and no listening test or phoneme lip-sync claim is made.\n\nThe actual gameplay job still logs four unresolved exit-resource diagnostics: KartAI 4, GarageTargets 2, KartRivalDrift 4, KartFullField 2. Workflow success does not erase these. The public evidence release is hash-bound; GitHub reports `immutable: false`. No success is transferred from failed full 47ca or historical Native 344 images. The separate Stage 2 and Sonnenhafen stunt workflows also completed successfully on 29080.\n\n## Remaining combined acceptance\n\n[Host PR503](https://github.com/Ullmann27/lumo-lernen/pull/503) now passes the complete2608 Flutter suite,599 script contracts and actual Android Host compilation. Its final Studio workflow requires exact-candidate authority pairs and actual Quiz/Memory/English Android probes on API35 andAPI37, in addition to every pre-existing tour/update/publication gate.\n\nCurrent full Native archive/image review, a final source pin and actual installed-APK acceptance remain outstanding. Known legacy resource-at-exit diagnostics are retained. No physical Fold7 60FPS, thermals or input-latency claim is made; no Main merge is requested.\n",
